        "class": "other",
        "severity": "low",
        "material": false,
        "claim": "Decision delivery does not run under the helm: helmTick runs the patterns, the spent-box question and the claim quota, but not runTickReports, where H2 put the call. Completed-day decisions are delayed while every seat on the host is at the helm.",
        "evidence": "internal/steward/tick.go: RunTick returns helmTick(...) before the deferred runTickReports. helmTick calls runPatterns, askSpentBoxes and helmHealthPass but not noticeDecisions. The decisions are delivered later by any non-helm seat, or after the helm is released; nothing is lost.",
        "where": "metasystem/internal/steward/tick.go",
        "change": "Optional: also call noticeDecisions from helmTick, beside runPatterns.",
        "relation": "new; rule: reports run under the helm because the person at the helm needs them (helmTick comment, tick.go)"
      },
      {
        "id": "20261115t230614-48d8ff558f-r1-s3:2",
        "class": "other",
        "severity": "low",
        "material": false,
        "claim": "A grant decision whose class has no overrule line (ordering, recovery and the other old classes, or an outcome other than confirmed or partial) is delivered with an empty 'overrule: ' suffix.",
        "evidence": "humanauthority.OverruleLine returns empty for the default classes and for other outcomes; decision_report.go formats '...; overrule: %s' unconditionally, as H1 literally specifies.",
